---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Website Privacy Policy — Lakebird Software"
  description="How Lakebird Software handles information when you visit this website or contact the studio."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="privacy-page section-pad" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <div class="container privacy-page__container">
      <header class="privacy-page__hero" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">LAKEBIRD SOFTWARE / PRIVACY</span>
        <h1 id="privacy-title">Website Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy-page__intro">Your privacy matters. This page explains what information may be processed when you visit the Lakebird Software website, how it is used, and the choices available to you.</p>
        <div class="privacy-page__meta"><span>Effective date: 26 November 2026</span><span>Website: lakebird-software.github.io</span></div>
      </header>

      <div class="privacy-page__layout">
        <aside class="privacy-page__toc" aria-label="Privacy policy contents">
          <span class="eyebrow">ON THIS PAGE</span>
          <a href="#scope">1. Scope</a>
          <a href="#information">2. Information handled</a>
          <a href="#use">3. How information is used</a>
          <a href="#sharing">4. Sharing and service providers</a>
          <a href="#storage">5. Storage and retention</a>
          <a href="#choices">6. Your choices</a>
          <a href="#external">7. External services</a>
          <a href="#children">8. Children</a>
          <a href="#security">9. Security</a>
          <a href="#copyright">10. Copyright and trademarks</a>
          <a href="#changes">11. Policy updates</a>
          <a href="#contact-privacy">12. Contact</a>
        </aside>

        <article class="privacy-document">
          <section id="scope">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">01</span>
            <h2>Scope of this policy</h2>
            <p>This policy applies to the Lakebird Software website, including its pages, product information, navigation and contact links. It explains the website's information practices only.</p>
            <p>FINLY, GPS Camera and Filtra are separate Android applications. Their permissions, device data, backups, integrations and other app-specific practices are governed by their own privacy disclosures. This website policy does not replace or override an individual app's privacy policy.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="information">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">02</span>
            <h2>Information that may be handled</h2>
            <h3>Information you choose to send</h3>
            <p>The website does not provide a user account, registration process, newsletter subscription or contact form. If you choose to email us, we receive the information you include in that message, such as your email address, name (if supplied), message content and any attachments. Please avoid sending sensitive financial, identity or authentication information by email.</p>
            <h3>Basic technical information</h3>
            <p>The website is hosted using GitHub Pages. Like most web-hosting services, the hosting infrastructure may process technical request information to deliver pages, maintain security and diagnose service problems. Depending on the platform and its configuration, this can include an IP address, browser or device information, requested URL, referring page and request time. GitHub controls its hosting infrastructure and its own handling of this information under its applicable policies. Lakebird Software does not use this information to build advertising profiles.</p>
            <h3>Remembering your appearance preference</h3>
            <p>If you switch between dark and light appearance, the website may store that preference in your browser's local storage so the site can remember your selection on a later visit. This preference is stored locally in your browser and is not used by Lakebird Software to identify you.</p>
            <h3>Optional analytics cookies</h3>
            <p>If you choose “Accept Cookies”, the website loads Google Analytics 4 to help us understand overall website usage. It uses first-party cookies such as <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code> to distinguish browsers and measure visits and interactions. Information may include pages viewed, interaction events, referring pages, browser and device details, and an approximate geographic area. Optional analytics is not loaded when you choose “Reject”.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="use">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">03</span>
            <h2>How information is used</h2>
            <p>Information you voluntarily send by email is used to read and respond to your enquiry, provide support, consider feedback and maintain relevant correspondence records.</p>
            <p>Technical request information may be processed by the hosting provider to deliver the website, protect the service, prevent abuse and troubleshoot errors. The locally stored theme preference is used only to remember your display choice.</p>
            <p>Lakebird Software does not use this website for behavioural advertising or sell visitor information. Optional website analytics runs only after you choose “Accept Cookies”. If you choose “Reject”, the analytics tag is not loaded and optional analytics cookies are not set by this website. You can change your choice later using the “Cookie preferences” link in the website footer.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="sharing">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">04</span>
            <h2>Sharing and service providers</h2>
            <p>Lakebird Software does not sell or rent personal information received through this website, and does not share email enquiries with advertisers for targeted advertising.</p>
            <p>Some information may nevertheless be processed by third parties that make the website or linked services work. These include:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>GitHub Pages:</strong> website hosting and delivery. GitHub may process technical request data under its own privacy and service terms.</li>
              <li><strong>Google Fonts:</strong> this website requests selected typefaces from Google Fonts. When a browser loads those fonts, Google may receive technical request information such as the IP address and browser details needed to deliver the font files.</li>
              <li><strong>Website analytics:</strong> If you accept optional cookies, Google Analytics 4 processes website usage information to provide aggregated reports about visits and interactions. Google may process this information under its own privacy terms. See the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
              <li><strong>Google Play:</strong> download buttons link to Google Play. If you follow a link, Google processes your visit under Google's own privacy terms.</li>
              <li><strong>Email provider:</strong> when you contact us, your email is transmitted and stored through the email services used by you and by the recipient.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Information may also be disclosed where required by law, to respond to valid legal requests, or where reasonably necessary to protect the rights, safety and security of Lakebird Software, visitors or the public.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="storage">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">05</span>
            <h2>Storage and retention</h2>
            <p>The theme preference is stored in your browser's local storage until you clear it or your browser removes it. It is not an account record.</p>
            <p>Your cookie choice (accepted or rejected) is remembered in this browser's local storage so the banner does not appear on every page visit. If you accept optional analytics, analytics cookies are stored by the browser according to their configured lifetimes. Analytics event-data retention is governed by the settings of the analytics property.</p>
            <p>Email correspondence is retained for as long as reasonably necessary to respond to the enquiry, provide support, maintain relevant business records or address a dispute. Hosting providers may retain technical logs according to their own operational, security and retention practices.</p>
            <p>Lakebird Software does not operate a website database or user-account system for this website.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="choices">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">06</span>
            <h2>Your choices</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>You can browse the website without creating an account or submitting a form.</li>
              <li>You can choose whether to email us. If you do, include only information needed for your enquiry.</li>
              <li>You can clear the website's saved theme preference by clearing this site's local storage in your browser settings.</li>
              <li>You can choose not to follow links to third-party services. Their services and privacy practices are controlled by those providers.</li>
              <li>You can choose “Accept Cookies” or “Reject” when the cookie banner appears. Optional analytics does not load unless you accept.</li>
              <li>You can reopen the banner and change your choice at any time using the “Cookie preferences” link in the website footer. You can also clear this site's stored preferences and cookies through your browser settings.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Depending on where you live, applicable privacy law may provide rights to request access, correction or deletion of personal information, or to object to or restrict certain processing. To make a privacy-related enquiry, contact us using the email address below. We may need to verify the request and may retain information where the law permits or requires it.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="external">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">07</span>
            <h2>External links and services</h2>
            <p>This website contains links to Google Play and may link to other third-party websites. Those sites are not operated by Lakebird Software. Their content, security and privacy practices are their own, so please review the relevant provider's policies before using them.</p>
            <p>For reference: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Privacy Statement</a> and <a href="https://developers.google.com/fonts/faq/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Fonts privacy information</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="children">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">08</span>
            <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
            <p>This website is a studio and product-information website and is not intended to collect personal information from children. It does not offer child-directed accounts, profiles or submission forms. If you believe a child has sent us personal information by email, please contact us so we can review the request.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="security">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">09</span>
            <h2>Security</h2>
            <p>We use the hosting and communication services available to us and take reasonable care when handling messages sent to our support email. No internet transmission or storage method can be guaranteed to be completely secure. Please do not email passwords, payment-card details, private keys or other highly sensitive information.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="copyright">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">10</span>
            <h2>Copyright, applications and trademarks</h2>
            <p>Unless otherwise stated, the Lakebird Software website, original written content, visual design, graphics, application names, software, interface designs, screenshots and associated product materials are protected by copyright and other applicable intellectual-property laws. FINLY, GPS Camera and Filtra and their original application materials are owned by Lakebird Software or the relevant rights holder. All rights are reserved. No right to copy, modify, redistribute or commercially exploit these materials is granted by visiting this website.</p>
            <p>Google Play and the Google Play badge are trademarks of Google LLC. The Google Play badge is displayed to link visitors to Google Play and is used in accordance with Google's badge guidance. Google is not the owner of Lakebird Software and does not imply sponsorship or endorsement of the studio or its applications. Other third-party names and marks remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="changes">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">11</span>
            <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this policy when the website, its services or applicable requirements change. The updated version will be published on this page with a revised effective or update date. Please review it periodically.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="contact-privacy">
            <span class="privacy-document__number">12</span>
            <h2>Contact Lakebird Software</h2>
            <p>For questions about this website privacy policy or a privacy-related request, contact:</p>
            <a class="privacy-contact" href="mailto:support.pbandroidapps@gmail.com">support.pbandroidapps@gmail.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <p class="privacy-page__note">This policy is for the Lakebird Software website. App-specific privacy policies are separate documents and should be reviewed on the relevant app listing or dedicated app policy page.</p>
          </section>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="privacy-page__back"><a class="text-link" href={base}>← Back to Lakebird Software</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
